OL,3,GNEWSAThe legacy of a prolific female
OL,4,ADorset folk singer
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnglish folk singer and guitarist
OL,7,FMartin Carthy was nominated for the
OL,8,Fprestigious Mercury Prize in 2025 for
OL,9,Fhis intriguingly titled album Transform
OL,10,FMe Then Into a Fish.
OL,12,FThe name came from a lyric in the song
OL,13,FYe Mariners All, a song collected from
OL,14,FDorset singer Marina Russell by Henry
OL,15,Fand Robert Hammond in the early 1900s.
OL,17,F"They were two very prim and proper
OL,18,FEdwardian gentlemen," said folklorist
OL,19,FNick Dow.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
